# Application-managed audio assets (VB-5B local storage).
#
# This directory is the FreeSWITCH-visible media root. In Docker it is bind
# mounted read-only into the FreeSWITCH container as /media/obd.
#
# Audio files are runtime data, not source. They are produced by the
# application's LocalAudioStorage (audio/{tenant}/{asset}/{file}) and must
# never be committed.
*
!.gitignore
